<title>UK: Peugeot estimates cut at CS First Boston.</title>
<headline>Peugeot estimates cut at CS First Boston.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Friday it cut its earnings per share estimates for French carmaket PSA Peugeot Citroen in the wake of its disappointing 1996 results.</p>
<p>For 1997, CSFB analyst Susanne Oliver said she provisionally cut her estimate to 11.3 francs from 22.3 and for 1998 she cut to 20.4 francs from 34.6.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
